{
  "movie_id": 515800601,
  "subtitles": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start_time": 6.4,
      "end_time": 9.6,
      "text": "Io, do you have any ideas?"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start_time": 10.7,
      "end_time": 14.7,
      "text": "Yes. A certain action that's done at the\nclimax of a romance novel..."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start_time": 14.9,
      "end_time": 20.0,
      "text": "Also known as the greatest expression of\nlove～..."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start_time": 20.3,
      "end_time": 23.6,
      "text": "The greatest expression of love..."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start_time": 24.3,
      "end_time": 25.8,
      "text": "That's..."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start_time": 26.9,
      "end_time": 29.3,
      "text": "It's... a kiss!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start_time": 29.9,
      "end_time": 31.2,
      "text": "My...!"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start_time": 34.0,
      "end_time": 35.3,
      "text": "Huh...? Oh...?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start_time": 39.9,
      "end_time": 40.7,
      "text": "Ah...!"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start_time": 41.0,
      "end_time": 42.1,
      "text": "I'm going home"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start_time": 43.3,
      "end_time": 45.2,
      "text": "Huh...!? That's...!"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start_time": 49.0,
      "end_time": 51.5,
      "text": "Don't just up and leave! Please wait, Knight!"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start_time": 51.8,
      "end_time": 52.9,
      "text": "I don't wanna"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start_time": 53.7,
      "end_time": 55.5,
      "text": "Please don't say that"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start_time": 56.0,
      "end_time": 58.3,
      "text": "That's right. Please cooperate with us"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start_time": 58.5,
      "end_time": 61.5,
      "text": "It's all... for your sake..."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start_time": 61.7,
      "end_time": 62.9,
      "text": "Alright~"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start_time": 64.1,
      "end_time": 66.0,
      "text": "...Io, now's our chance"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start_time": 66.4,
      "end_time": 69.1,
      "text": "Yes. Then, please go ahead"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start_time": 69.6,
      "end_time": 71.1,
      "text": "... Huh?"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start_time": 71.3,
      "end_time": 74.4,
      "text": "Wait, could it be I'm the only one doing it?"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start_time": 75.0,
      "end_time": 76.8,
      "text": "Well if I, as his teacher, do it..."
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start_time": 76.8,
      "end_time": 81.2,
      "text": "I'd end up in an inappropriate relationship\nwith my student..."
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start_time": 81.6,
      "end_time": 86.2,
      "text": "N-No way... But I'm the Princess of a foreign\ncountry..."
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start_time": 86.4,
      "end_time": 87.1,
      "text": "...Hm?"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start_time": 87.3,
      "end_time": 88.1,
      "text": "...!"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start_time": 91.3,
      "end_time": 95.4,
      "text": "(You're in such a difficult situation, while\nI...)"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start_time": 96.5,
      "end_time": 99.5,
      "text": "...Ah, let's go with this then *whisper*"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start_time": 102.1,
      "end_time": 103.3,
      "text": "I see..."
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start_time": 103.5,
      "end_time": 104.6,
      "text": "What do you think?"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start_time": 104.9,
      "end_time": 108.7,
      "text": "I suppose that will do... I think"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start_time": 109.3,
      "end_time": 111.4,
      "text": "Let's deliver both our feelings together"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start_time": 111.6,
      "end_time": 112.4,
      "text": "Yes..."
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start_time": 114.0,
      "end_time": 115.3,
      "text": "*sigh*..."
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start_time": 115.8,
      "end_time": 120.2,
      "text": "(In the unconscious world, you conveyed your\nfeelings to me...)"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start_time": 120.8,
      "end_time": 123.3,
      "text": "(Now it's my turn.)"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start_time": 127.8,
      "end_time": 129.2,
      "text": "Zzzzzz..."
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start_time": 129.9,
      "end_time": 131.4,
      "text": "(I...)"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start_time": 132.5,
      "end_time": 134.0,
      "text": "(You are...)"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start_time": 146.9,
      "end_time": 148.3,
      "text": "Hmm..."
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start_time": 151.0,
      "end_time": 151.8,
      "text": "What's the matter?"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start_time": 152.0,
      "end_time": 153.0,
      "text": "Ahh!"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start_time": 153.4,
      "end_time": 155.5,
      "text": "M-My, you don't remember?"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "start_time": 159.3,
      "end_time": 164.0,
      "text": "Geez, you can be so unfair... Hehe"
    }
  ],
